<title>USA: Xyplex Networks in modem pact with Microcom.</title>
<headline>Xyplex Networks in modem pact with Microcom.</headline>
<dateline>LITTLETON, Mass. 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Whittaker Corp unit Xyplex Networks said that Microcom Inc has agreed to integrate its 56-kilobit modem card into Xyplex Networks' EdgeBlaster wide area network server.</p>
<p>Financial details were not disclosed.</p>
<p>By adding Microcom's modem technology to EdgeBlaster, Xyplex says it will give customers more wide area network bandwidth to link remote and branch offices to the corporate network and offers Internet Service Providers high-speed access to their subscribers.</p>
<p>EdgeBlaster, including Microcom's 8-port 56 kilobit modem technology, will be available in the second half of 1997, the company said.</p>
</text>
